arStrings.szText:
{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
When you gain excess Primary Resource, spawn a Piece of Ore. After {c_number}[{SF_1}|1|]{/c} seconds the Piece of Ore explodes dealing {c_random}{payload:Damage_Tooltip}{/c} Fire damage. You can spawn up to {c_number}{SF_4}{/c} Pieces of Ore at once.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if} 

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Activating your {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power spends all your Primary Resource to increase its damage by {c_random}[{SF_10}|x2%|]{/c} per Resource point spent.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
